Short:    Powerfull WHO/FRONTEND DOOR for FAME BBS
Uploader: dr.dre@devilspoint.niederrhein.de.de (Bodo Hoffmann)
Author:   dr.dre@devilspoint.niederrhein.de.de (Bodo Hoffmann)
Type:     comm/bbs/

This is a very powerfull who/frontend replacement for fame.
It`s features the following things.

 - unlimited styles (public version is limited to have 2)
 - preferences editor to save the choosen style
 - Argument parsing - you can use WHO 2 to view style #2
 - totally free configuring of the stlyes via config-files
 - supports 100% hidden mode
 - own identify how to run as who or as frontend door
 - supports monitor mode
 - supports the FORCE mode

 This door needs the FAME Mainpart v1.13+, the FAME.library and
 the DRE.library. Both librarys are in the Archive included.

